---
title: Writing
layout: base
permalink: /blog/
excerpt: "Notes on running an engineering team, the systems we build, and life outside work."
---

<div class="container page-pad">
    <h1 class="page-title">Writing</h1>
    <p class="lead">Notes on running an engineering team, the systems we build, and life outside work.</p>

    {% set activePillar = '' %}
    {% include "pillar-filter.njk" %}

    {%- for group in collections.writingByYear %}
        <section class="year-group" aria-labelledby="year-{{ group.year }}">
            <h2 id="year-{{ group.year }}" class="year-group-title">{{ group.year }}</h2>
            <ul class="year-group-list">
                {%- for post in group.items %}
                    {%- set p = post.data.pillar | pillar %}
                    <li>
                        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | dayMonth }}</time>
                        <a class="year-group-link" href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
                        {% if p %}<a class="pill" href="/tags/{{ p.slug }}/">{{ p.name }}</a>{% endif %}
                    </li>
                {%- endfor %}
            </ul>
        </section>
    {%- endfor %}

    <section class="archive-panel" aria-labelledby="archive">
        <h2 id="archive" class="archive-panel-title"><a href="/blog/archive/">Archive, 2013–2017</a></h2>
        <p>Written when I was a junior developer, and kept for posterity. Most of the technical detail is now out of date.</p>
        {% include "archive-grid.njk" %}
    </section>
</div>
